      "text": "**Possibly a little better, but don’t expect the haze to clear.** For Sunday, October 18, NEA expects showers and a shift in winds that could reduce smoke drifting from Kalimantan, though haze from Sumatra may still reach Singapore. The latest report still forecasts **unhealthy to very unhealthy** air quality. ([channelnewsasia.com](https://www.channelnewsasia.com/singapore/singapore-haze-psi-pm25-oct-17-6466816))\n\nCheck NEA’s latest **1-hour PM2.5** readings before heading outdoors; they’re more useful for immediate decisions than the 24-hour PSI. ([haze.gov.sg](https://www.haze.gov.sg/))",
